@startuml
title Memento Pattern - Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

class EditorMemento {
    -text: String {final}
    -cursorPosition: int {final}
    -scrollPosition: int {final}
    -timestamp: Date {final}
    +EditorMemento(text: String, cursorPosition: int, scrollPosition: int)
    ~getText(): String
    ~getCursorPosition(): int
    ~getScrollPosition(): int
    +getTimestamp(): Date
    +getName(): String
}

class TextEditor {
    -text: String
    -cursorPosition: int
    -scrollPosition: int
    +setText(text: String): void
    +setCursor(pos: int): void
    +setScroll(pos: int): void
    +getText(): String
    +save(): EditorMemento
    +restore(memento: EditorMemento): void
}

class EditorHistory {
    -history: Stack<EditorMemento>
    +save(editor: TextEditor): void
    +undo(editor: TextEditor): void
    +showHistory(): void
}

TextEditor --> EditorMemento : creates >
EditorHistory --> EditorMemento : stores >
EditorHistory ..> TextEditor : save/restore

note bottom of EditorMemento
  Immutable snapshot:
  data set only via constructor
end note

note bottom of TextEditor
  Originator: creates and
  restores from mementos
end note

note bottom of EditorHistory
  Caretaker: manages
  history of mementos
end note

@enduml
